.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/457176-more-path-names\">Ways and Archetypes </a>[a kith like system for mages] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/688243-setting-hack-magical-origin\">Magical Origin</a> [a system for alternative origins for mages without the Watchtowers] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1124349-faces-of-the-exarchs-just-for-fun\">Faces of the Exarchs</a> [the shapes the exarch may take when dealing with mortals] <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1132317-the-warden-setting-material\">The Warden</a> [heretical Iron Seal which governs upon the Lower Depths]<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Hunter</span>-</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/19068-learning-the-sixth-castigation-mine-and-an-alternative\">Sixth Castigation Rules</a> [alternative mechanics for learning more than 5 Castigations- at great cost]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/518231-hunters-around-the-globe\">Hunters Around the Globe! </a>[mapping the Hunters orgs and similar groups all around the world]<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Core</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/139138-the-pythian-oracles-slashing-conspiracy\">Pythian Oracles</a> [prophets and diviners who are willing to kill in the name of a better future]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/16573-conspiracy-raziel-ltd-wip\">Raziel Ltd</a> [Israeli weapon company protecting its