-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1224144-domus-sanctus-compact\">Domus Sanctus</a> [cleaners of tainted places which try to literally fix the world]<br /> Moving Up the Tiers <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32396-moving-up-in-the-tiers-compacts-into-conspiracies\">1 </a>/ <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/398609-moving-up-the-tiers-2\">2</a> [cause everyone can be a conspiracy!]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/810144-the-inspired-hunter-lesser-template\">Inspired</a> [a microtemplate meant to make a divine inspired agents of Heaven]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/695939-the-civil-war-when-conspiracies-fall\">Civil Wars</a> [see what happens when conspiracies fall.. and how they rise again]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/573832-mixing-my-to-do-hunter-group-list\">To Do List </a>[so many ideas to develop, so little time]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/864775-heirs-of-the-lie-also-known-as-project-o-x-sum-up-post\">Heirs of the Lie</a> [when the Exrachs themselves stand vigilant]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/866426-strains-of-the-cursed-blood\">Strains of the Cursed Blood</a> [the many demonic bloodlines who stand against Hell]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/923441-vigilant-times-take-2-open-invite\">Vigilant Times</a> [the history of the Vigil, expanded upon Dark Eras and other historic settings]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/970215-from-monsters-to-hunters-setting-hack\">From Monsters to Hunters</a> [reimagining the big bads of the CofD as the good guys.. sort of]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1053123-slashing-conspiracies-take-2\">Slashing Conspiracies</a> [Cabals based around being dark mirrors to the major conspiracies of the world]<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Night Stalkers</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/407911-hunter-cult-cage-of-shadows\">Cage of Shadows</a> [an heretic Jewish sect which hunts after the children of Lilith]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/853170-scharlach-spinnwebe-nightstalkers-project-o-x-v\">Schrlach Spinnwebe</a> [a modern slave traders who apply a network of blood dolls in order to enslave vampires]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/893684-al-rih-al-asuad-strains-of-the-cursed-blood-mesopotamia\">Al-Rih al-Asuad</a> [descendants of the mesopotemian wind demons who fight against the spawn of Lamashtu]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1138699-the-tecuanimeh-cabal\">Tecuanimeh</a> [servants of the Smoking Mirror who make sacrifices to hungry relics to survive under the black sun]<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Spirit Slayers</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/403378-new-conspiracy-aki-ten\">Aki Ten</a> [modern incarnation of the Onmyodo in Japan who wish to protect their people and reclaim their glory]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/519785-the-e-v-e-institution\">E.V.E Institution</a> [Australian biologists who seek to advance humanity to its next form]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/634487-the-nibiru-conspiracy\">Nibiru </a>[claims to be the oldest hunters in the world, the maintain the bindings of ancient gods and seal new ones]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/698943-bowery-dogs-silver-syndicate\">Silver Syndicate </a>[part time investment company, part time criminal organization, full time shapeshifter hunters]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/841192-followers-of-set-full-writeup\">Followers of Set</a> [modern incarnation of ancient cult which relays on monsters to fight worse horrors]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/845188-church-of-the-blood-moon-spiritslayers-project-o-x-vii\">Church of the Blood Moon</a> [heretic priesthood who lures the wolves of the devil with mystical songs as shepherds]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1003591-lycos-agema-vigilant-times-to-the-strongest\">Lycos Agema </a>[spartan werewolf hunters who seek to proof themselves as the greatest warriors]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1011415-hrt-isfet-strains-of-cursed-blood-north-africa\">Hrt Isfet </a>[bloodline who carries the venom of an ancient demon in their veins and use it to fight chaos's spawns]<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#40E0D0\">Witch Finders</span>