raiders-project-x-o-vi\">Eye of Heaven</a> [advisers and kingmakers dedicated to control the sleeping gods in Heaven's name]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1015191-avici-sutra-strains-of-the-cursed-blood-indian-subcontinent\">Avici Sutra</a> [souls reincarnated as lords among the asura who seek to escape to cycle of suffering by defeating demons]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1094499-r-a-m-new-conspiracy\">R.A.M </a>[israeli governmental agency which protects its country from dangerous relics and the cults built around them]<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#a9a9a9\">Hell Binders</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/404571-semi-comapct-theater-of-tragedies\">Theater of Tragedies</a> [brothel of cross dressers who make deals with the devil and cheat their way out]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/577395-the-nimrod-movement\">The Nimrod Movement</a> [former atheists who take over angels to bring down God and free mankind]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/592476-heirs-of-the-crown-spanish-inquisition\">Heirs of the Crown</a> [heretics who banish demons to purify themselves through sin]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/739877-cult-of-moloch-convention\">Cult of Moloch </a>[a scattered group of killers who are willing to sacrifice anything to make their wishes come true]<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/859835-mourningstar-developments-hellbinders-project-o-x-i\">MourningS