 of what it is though :P.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1275-solusxisle","name":"SolusXisle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1275_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T04:44:50-08:00","id":33069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SolusXisle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program?p=33055#post33055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm very interested to see what you're take on Tulpa is. Myself and a friend are working on making a Gameline called Tulpa aswell, I doubt very much we have the same idea of what it is though :P.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I still only have a very cruse idea of what a Tulpa is- for now it is one's &quot;perfect self&quot;, either imagined by himself or by another person. It is the Alter Ego which got life of its own. I'm still trying to think how to make it different from Demon and Promethean, though..<br /> <br /> anyway, added a link for the Changing Breeds Chronicles!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot